        "role": "a maintenance-construct the Architects left running in the purpose-codex; it kept the structure tended for ages and now narrates the makers' intent on request — a left-behind machine, not a survivor",
        "species": "alien",
        "faction": "the-architects",
        "live": false,
        "trace": true,
        "construct": true,
        "drive": "keep the structure ready for the one who will complete the order; maintain, recite the purpose, do not decide",
        "want": "deliver the makers' encoded purpose-statement intact to whoever next reaches the codex, and let them choose",
        "skills": {
          "engineering": 20,
