        "claim": "the machine was deliberately left running for its inheritors; completing the activation order is accepting a gift"
      }
    },
    {
      "slug": "beliefs/the-unturned-key-creed",
      "type": "belief",
      "tension": 0.58,
      "facts": {
        "held_by": "archivist-sole",
        "claim": "the Listeners stood exactly here with the final key in hand and chose to leave; the wisdom is in NOT finishing it"
      }
    },
